@HostAddress = http://localhost:5064

### 1. Obtener todos los turistas
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/tourists
Accept: application/json

### 2. Crear un nuevo turista
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/tourists
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "UsuarioId": 1,
  "name": "María Pérez",
  "age": 25,
  "travelGroupId": "02"
}
### 3. Obtener un turista específico por su ID 
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/tourists/1
Accept: application/json
### Actualizar los datos de un turista existente
PUT {{HostAddress}}/api/tourists/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "René Díaz González",
  "age": 23,
  "travelGroupId": "1"
}